--TEST--
a cursor on the `return` keyword is in the statement and outside the value it returns, which is a position, and the method's parameters and `$this` are in scope there, `rule:ide/the-index-answers-the-cursor`
--FILE--
<?nvs
class Counter {
    public function next(int $n): int {
        retu<|>rn $n + 1;
    }
}
--REQUEST--
